an.baidu.com/v?pd=wisenatural&amp;vid=5808180713121792166" data-url="https://haokan.baidu.com/v?pd=wisenatural&amp;vid=5808180713121792166"><span>haokan.baidu.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>异形（1979）</span></p><span></span><p><span>银翼杀手（1982）</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：揪心的玩笑与漫长的白日梦 - 万能青年旅店</span></p>]]></description>
